{"ref":"BDB, רֹק²","hw":"רֹק²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֹק</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>spittle</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.6\">Is 50:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:10\" href=\"/Job.30.10\">Jb 30:10</a> (both of contemptuous spitting); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֻקִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:19\" href=\"/Job.7.19\">7:19</a> while I swallow <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּלַע)</span> <em>my spittle</em>, i.e. for the briefest time.","next":"BDB, רַקּוֹן²","prev":"BDB, רָקַק"}